      "pos": "V",
      "ayah_id": "43:8",
      "ayah_arabic": "فَأَهۡلَكۡنَآ أَشَدَّ مِنۡهُم بَطۡشࣰ ا وَمَضَىٰ مَثَلُ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ",
      "surah_revelation": "Meccan",
      "surah_name": "Az-Zukhruf",
      "literal_gloss": "and has passed",
      "translations": {
        "saheeh": "And We destroyed greater than them in [striking] power, and the example of the former peoples has preceded.",
        "pickthall": "Then We destroyed men mightier than these in prowess; and the example of the men of old hath gone (before them).",
        "khattab": "So We destroyed those who were far mightier than these ˹Meccans˺. The examples of ˹their˺ predecessors have ˹already˺ been related",
        "arberry": "so We destroyed men stronger in valour than they, and the example of the ancients passed away."
      }
    }
